Package: laya-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/laya-rs
Description: Rust (candle) inference for Laya's typed-decision engine
 laya answers typed choice/score/noul questions over an arbitrary state
 (text, email, ticket, or JSON) in a single non-autoregressive forward pass
 through a ModernBERT/mmBERT encoder plus a from-scratch decision head — no
 text generation, calibrated probabilities out. Point it at a local
 convaiinnovations/laya checkpoint directory; weights are not bundled.
